    <decisions>
        <name>Can_Dispatch</name>
        <label>배정할 수 있는가</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Screen_Guide</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>안내만</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Can_Dispatch_Yes</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varSuccess</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Screen_Dispatch</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>배정 가능</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Is_Dispatched</name>
        <label>출동을 만들었는가</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Screen_Guide</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>실패</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Is_Dispatched_Yes</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varSuccess</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Screen_Done</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>성공</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description
  >26-10-16 접수 [기사 배정]: 접수 요약을 보여 주고 우리 센터 기사·출동 목적·방문 예정 일시를 받아 출동 생성(DispatchService, 시스템 모드), 접수는 처리 중으로. 종결·취소 접수·권한 없음은 안내만. 같은 접수에 다시 쓰면 새 출동 by Edwin</description>
    <dynamicChoiceSets>
        <name>PurposeChoices</name>
